{"h":3390,"lines":[{"w":0.37371663411458333,"h":0.016224188790560423,"y":0.092920354186179721,"t":"high performers - curiosity, persistence and","c":1,"x":0.082135522699677208},{"h":0.017699115044247704,"t":"hard work, for example - an approach Eyre","y":0.11032448394013616,"c":1,"x":0.082135522675087974,"w":0.37371663411458333},{"y":0.126453488680356,"w":0.38398356119791666,"h":0.018974240058291292,"t":"calls 'high performance learning'. Critically,","x":0.082135530592006775,"c":1},{"t":"they need the right support in developing those","y":0.14534883722017178,"c":1,"h":0.017483021446385583,"x":0.080082141893559819,"w":0.40451744079589841},{"c":1,"w":0.35129880269368491,"x":0.079978935526297146,"h":0.01743194107460766,"y":0.16295046711196093,"t":"approaches at home as well as at school."},{"h":0.016001234926656949,"x":0.082135529093499901,"w":0.37577000935872396,"c":1,"y":0.1991150440207009,"t":"Prof Anders Ericsson, an eminent education"},{"c":1,"y":0.21651917386632302,"t":"psychologist at Florida State University, US,","h":0.016038965545924322,"w":0.38398356119791666,"x":0.082135529369364427},{"x":0.080082141785021571,"w":0.40041066487630206,"h":0.014749262536873142,"c":1,"t":"is the co-author of Peak: Secrets from the New","y":0.23392330380462378},{"w":0.35934290568033861,"c":1,"y":0.25132743355490117,"h":0.016224188790560534,"t":"Science of Expertise. After research going","x":0.082135528503773259},{"h":0.017603951288183817,"c":1,"t":"back to 1980 into diverse achievements, from","y":0.26872450665729963,"w":0.39032338460286459,"x":0.082050979532262244},{"x":0.082135522537667788,"c":1,"y":0.2863372093220824,"w":0.36960985819498693,"h":0.017497598878753573,"t":"music to memory to sport, he doesn't think"},{"y":0.30377906988050118,"w":0.37371663411458328,"h":0.015988371857499573,"c":1,"t":"unique and innate talents are at the heart of","x":0.080082134591458173},{"y":0.31985388951999982,"h":0.019476152943298852,"t":"performance. Deliberate practice, that stretches","x":0.082013856063883714,"w":0.40476811726888012,"c":1},{"x":0.08008214530382711,"w":0.39219711303710936,"h":0.018915070615335261,"y":0.33864306818614009,"t":"you every step of the way, and around 10,000","c":1},{"w":0.37186566670735677,"t":"hours of it, is what produces the goods. It's","x":0.079985575174735285,"y":0.35601930504376167,"h":0.018732553105087035,"c":1},{"h":0.016062118170183992,"x":0.080082134988287479,"y":0.37492625379835964,"c":1,"t":"not a magic number - the highest performers","w":0.38603696187337244},{"w":0.39630388895670576,"t":"move on to doing a whole lot more, of course.","x":0.08213552976827572,"h":0.017699115044247815,"c":1,"y":0.39233038355147709},{"t":"Ericsson's memory research is particalarly","y":0.40789219793713027,"w":0.36580795288085938,"c":1,"h":0.019378932176438046,"x":0.081958447937874532},{"y":0.42877906988088244,"t":"interesting because random students, trained","c":1,"h":0.016058688318483227,"w":0.38193018595377604,"x":0.080082134845965575},{"x":0.079715127719797704,"t":"in memory techniques for the study, went on","y":0.44320940688185173,"w":0.38456860860188796,"h":0.022072641828418837,"c":1},{"w":0.39014373779296885,"t":"to outperform others thought to have innately","c":1,"x":0.080082137674357484,"h":0.017441860412777621,"y":0.46220930217733214},{"t":"superior memories - those who you might","x":0.080082138020415486,"y":0.47964601782129246,"w":0.36550308227539069,"c":1,"h":0.017447005190328935},{"x":0.080046041934792436,"h":0.016208124301426596,"y":0.49843663549928929,"w":0.09658142725626627,"t":"call gifted.","c":1},{"x":0.082135523577161446,"t":"But it is perhaps the work of Benjamin Bloom,","y":0.53333333317169662,"h":0.016224188790560534,"w":0.40246406555175773,"c":1},{"t":"another distinguished American educationist","x":0.080082141276683338,"w":0.38398356119791671,"c":1,"h":0.016224188790560534,"y":0.55073746301717008},{"t":"working in the 1980s, that gives the most","x":0.082135528408239608,"h":0.016051828052441985,"y":0.56831395359837256,"w":0.35523612976074215,"c":1},{"x":0.080082141146355451,"c":1,"w":0.37987678527832036,"h":0.016014097433174612,"t":"pause for thought. Bloom's team looked at a","y":0.58575581406558053},{"h":0.018798722348733699,"w":0.4026656341552734,"y":0.6018889045269995,"c":1,"t":"group of extraordinarily high achieving people","x":0.079970756751503558},{"h":0.017441860412777732,"y":0.62063953490481982,"w":0.38193018595377604,"c":1,"t":"in disciplines as varied as ballet, swimming,","x":0.080082134838163774},{"y":0.63952802347589799,"c":1,"h":0.017448720678818974,"w":0.39835728963216144,"t":"piano, tennis, maths, sculpture and neurology.","x":0.078028747270477469},{"w":0.3634496815999349,"x":0.080082140610648,"h":0.016032962742808299,"c":1,"y":0.65693215341365463,"t":"He found a pattern of parents encouraging"},{"t":"and supporting their children, often in areas","y":0.67433628325875827,"w":0.37577000935872401,"h":0.016070693362075672,"c":1,"x":0.08008214099559964},{"y":0.047080411298534686,"c":1,"h":0.014808500621874443,"x":0.83558580494847068,"t":"Reading","w":0.082622458140055421},{"x":0.50924025266679995,"t":"they enjoyed themselves. Bloom's outstanding","y":0.09292035418277278,"h":0.016224188790560423,"c":1,"w":0.40041066487630217},{"t":"people had worked very hard and consistently","x":0.50912122510450508,"c":1,"h":0.018739692440426836,"y":0.10920610503957984,"w":0.3944573720296225},{"y":0.12546722763749085,"x":0.50694115756812497,"c":1,"t":"at something they had become hooked on when","w":0.41111986796061195,"h":0.021600985456708632},{"t":"at a young age, and their parents all emerged as","w":0.41067761739095043,"x":0.50718685849138301,"y":0.14534883706105306,"h":0.017483021446385583,"c":1},{"y":0.16255656220882608,"x":0.50705760868753758,"h":0.017839994402409909,"c":1,"w":0.33294128417968749,"t":"having strong work ethics themselves."},{"t":"Eyre says we know how high performers","x":0.50924024479537655,"w":0.35318275451660153,"h":0.016001234926656949,"c":1,"y":0.19911504401971891},{"x":0.50718685700325106,"h":0.016038965545924433,"c":1,"w":0.36139630635579423,"y":0.21651917386572206,"t":"learn. From that she has developed a high"},{"y":0.23244837733692836,"c":1,"t":"performing learning approach. She is working","x":0.50924025523930627,"h":0.017551622418879087,"w":0.39630388895670576},{"t":"on this with a group of schools, both in Britain","x":0.50924025275753382,"w":0.40041066487630206,"h":0.016224188790560534,"y":0.25132743355096365,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.50703350089856825,"h":0.019239701352639971,"t":"and abroad. Some spin-off research, which","w":0.369928461710612,"y":0.26757193680812352},{"t":"looked in detail at 24 of the 3,000 children","w":0.36786860148111977,"h":0.017585417935981895,"x":0.50704053649089853,"c":1,"y":0.2854994647506347},{"h":0.0174598682594862,"c":1,"y":0.30377906961919254,"t":"being studied who were succeeding despite","x":0.50924024987181216,"w":0.37166323343912755},{"t":"difficult circumstances, found something","h":0.019629625303555276,"c":1,"x":0.50698815212533188,"y":0.32043216438978783,"w":0.35359486897786463},{"y":0.34011627918223508,"w":0.36139630635579423,"x":0.50718685700201227,"t":"remarkable. Half were getting free school","h":0.015988371857499684,"c":1},{"h":0.017477876106194778,"t":"meals because of poverty, more than half were","x":0.50924024624773234,"y":0.35752212386204563,"w":0.39835728963216144,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.50718685704213695,"y":0.37345132762621158,"w":0.36960985819498693,"t":"living with a single parent, and four in five","h":0.017537044423871384},{"t":"were living in disadvantaged areas. Interviews","c":1,"h":0.016224188790560534,"w":0.39835728963216155,"x":0.5092402462563177,"y":0.39233038364576878},{"t":"uncovered strong evidence of an adult or adults","y":0.40988372104059234,"x":0.50718685211942327,"w":0.40862424214680992,"h":0.016074981239341257,"c":1},{"y":0.42588419765327257,"c":1,"t":"in the child's life who valued and supported","w":0.37809509277343756,"x":0.50705699347741695,"h":0.017831314559531464},{"t":"education, either in the immediate or extended","y":0.44476744187515949,"w":0.40041066487630206,"h":0.017474446254494014,"c":1,"x":0.50718686449662687},{"w":0.3616537475585937,"y":0.4602987271756378,"t":"family or in the child's wider community.","x":0.50707420223745681,"h":0.019464095574213025,"c":1},{"x":0.50924025266917494,"w":0.40041066487630206,"y":0.48110465089752363,"c":1,"t":"Children talked about the need to work hard at","h":0.013081395872222901},{"t":"school, to listen in class and keep trying.","c":1,"y":0.49601641140420905,"x":0.50704638160475024,"w":0.35137324015299476,"h":0.020306333468727011},{"x":0.5092402513649984,"y":0.53333333317155918,"w":0.35934290568033855,"h":0.016224188790560423,"t":"Let us end with Einstein, the epitome of a","c":1},{"w":0.39835728963216144,"y":0.55073746292564696,"h":0.017699115044247704,"c":1,"t":"genius. He clearly had curiosity, character and","x":0.50718685816887277},{"h":0.016051828052441985,"t":"determination. He struggled against rejection","c":1,"x":0.50718686414261549,"w":0.38809033711751295,"y":0.56831395359704961},{"c":1,"w":0.38809033711751295,"y":0.58575581404702537,"h":0.016014097433174612,"t":"in early life but was undeterred. Did he think","x":0.50718686385055212},{"w":0.40657084147135414,"h":0.01745129306759452,"x":0.50718685885364534,"c":1,"t":"he was a genius or even gifted? He once wrote:","y":0.60319767427035542},{"x":0.50924025201027945,"c":1,"w":0.37987678527832036,"y":0.62209302336875993,"h":0.015988371857499684,"t":"*It's not that I'm so smart, it's just that I stay"},{"h":0.019546873379597707,"c":1,"y":0.63799346748336661,"w":0.40063570658365899,"t":"with problems longer. Most people say it is the","x":0.50912568715246898},{"w":0.38193018595377604,"h":0.016032962742808299,"t":"intellect which makes a great scientist. They","x":0.50718685760240723,"y":0.65693215341266442,"c":1},{"x":0.50691923142757023,"y":0.67285158966457115,"c":1,"t":"are wrong: it is character.'","w":0.22854454040527339,"h":0.018531002618570214},{"x":0.88911704378859968,"w":0.028747431437174509,"c":1,"t":"49","y":0.92151162797098229,"h":0.014534883302221524},{"h":0.04166666666666663,"w":0.45882354736328113,"c":1,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","y":0.94166666658950615,"x":0.51176469618764042}],"w":2400}